== HTTPS served with the certificate site, renewed today
GET https://127.0.0.1/ trusting the stand-in CA's root alone: 200, served by certs with the certificate site, version 2, serial 3511a94f8592481e6e80246e114bd66e
its chain verified by x509 at the demo's clock for certs.test and 127.0.0.1: true
GET https://127.0.0.1/ trusting the system's own authorities alone: refused, the stand-in's root being no authority of the system
